              contactInfo="Consume data from SQL Server, OLE DB, ODBC, or Oracle by using the corresponding .NET Framework data provider.;Microsoft Corporation; Microsoft SQL Server; (C) Microsoft Corporation; All Rights Reserved; http://www.microsoft.com/sql/support;4"
